{
  "slug": "bicycle-and-pedestrian-safety-during-shorter-days",
  "title": "Bicycle and Pedestrian Safety During Shorter Days",
  "excerpt": "As the days grow shorter, visibility on Colorado’s roads changes dramatically. Dusk and early morning hours can make it difficult for both drivers and pedestrians to see one another. Understanding how to share the road safely is essential for everyone’s protection. At Dormer Harpring, we’ve seen how preventable collisions happen when attention or visibility lapses. […]",
  "publishedAt": "2025-11-21T10:20:48",
  "modifiedAt": "2025-11-21T10:20:48",
  "categories": [
    "bike-accidents"
  ],
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58a",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l585",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s584",
          "text": "As the days grow shorter, visibility on Colorado’s roads changes dramatically. Dusk and early morning hours can make it difficult for both drivers and pedestrians to see one another. Understanding how to share the road safely is essential for everyone’s protection. At ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s586",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "l585",
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s587",
          "text": ", we’ve seen how preventable collisions happen when attention or visibility lapses. Promoting awareness of ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s588",
          "text": "pedestrian and bicycle safety",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s589",
          "text": " helps reduce serious injuries and keeps Colorado communities safer year-round.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "i58b",
      "src": "./images/2025-11-shutterstock_2488214053-1-300x214.jpg",
      "alt": "Bicycle Accident in the night"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58d",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58c",
          "text": "Tips for Pedestrians",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58f",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58e",
          "text": "Pedestrians face greater risks during low-light conditions. Reduced daylight affects a driver’s ability to react quickly, especially near intersections or unlit crossings. To stay safe, practice these habits every time you walk near traffic:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58h",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58g",
          "text": "Always pause at the edge of the road, curb, or corner before entering the street.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58j",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58i",
          "text": "Look left, right, left again, and glance over your shoulder for any turning vehicles before stepping off the curb.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58l",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58k",
          "text": "Keep scanning for approaching cars as you cross, staying alert until you reach the other side.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58m",
          "text": "Put your phone away and stay focused on your surroundings.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58t",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l58p",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.codot.gov/programs/bikeped/pedestrians"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58o",
          "text": "As the",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58q",
          "text": " Colorado Department of Transportation (CDOT)",
          "marks": [
            "l58p"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58s",
          "text": " explains, pavement markings act as visual guides for pedestrians, showing where to cross safely. While they don’t physically shield you from traffic, these bright, white crosswalk lines remind drivers to look out for and yield to people walking across the street.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58v",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58u",
          "text": "Tips for Bicyclists",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58x",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58w",
          "text": "Cyclists must adapt their routines when daylight shortens. Visibility tools and predictable riding behavior can dramatically reduce crash risks. Follow these safety practices:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b58z",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s58y",
          "text": "Equip your bike with front white lights and rear red reflectors.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b591",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s590",
          "text": "Use bike lanes where available, and ride in the same direction as traffic.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b593",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s592",
          "text": "Avoid weaving between vehicles or passing on the right at intersections.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b595",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s594",
          "text": "Signal every turn and stop clearly.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b597",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s596",
          "text": "Keep both hands ready to brake, especially when roads are wet or icy.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b599",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s598",
          "text": "Colorado law requires cyclists to follow the same traffic regulations as drivers. Maintaining situational awareness is one of the best defenses against collisions involving both bikes and vehicles.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59b",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59a",
          "text": "Tips for Drivers",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59d",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59c",
          "text": "Drivers play a major role in preventing accidents during the darker months. Adjusting driving habits to the season helps protect others who share the road:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59f",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59e",
          "text": "Slow down in neighborhoods and near schools, especially before sunrise and after sunset.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59h",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59g",
          "text": "Keep your windshield clean to reduce glare from headlights or streetlights.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59j",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59i",
          "text": "Turn on your headlights at least one hour before sunset to increase visibility.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59l",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59k",
          "text": "Double-check blind spots and crosswalks before turning.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59m",
          "text": "Avoid distractions, especially during rush-hour traffic when visibility is limited.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59p",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59o",
          "text": "Even a brief moment of inattention can have devastating consequences. Recognizing cyclists and pedestrians as rightful users of the road fosters safer, more respectful driving throughout Colorado.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59t",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l59r",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-bicycle-accident-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59q",
          "text": "What to Do After a Pedestrian or ",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59s",
          "text": "Bicycle Accident",
          "marks": [
            "strong",
            "l59r"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59v",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59u",
          "text": "After any collision involving a pedestrian or bicyclist, safety should be your first concern. Taking the right steps immediately can make a major difference in your physical recovery and the strength of your legal claim:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59x",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59w",
          "text": "Move to a safe area and check for injuries before anything else.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b59z",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s59y",
          "text": "Take photos of the scene, vehicle damage, lighting, and weather conditions.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5a1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5a0",
          "text": "Call 911 to report the crash and request medical assistance.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5a3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5a2",
          "text": "Seek medical care as soon as possible, even if injuries seem minor.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5a5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5a4",
          "text": "Exchange insurance and contact details with the driver and any witnesses.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5a9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5a6",
          "text": "Because ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5a7",
          "text": "pedestrian and bicycle safety",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5a8",
          "text": " laws can be complex, consulting a personal injury lawyer right away ensures that evidence is preserved, liability is properly evaluated, and your rights are fully protected.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
